    "turn_text": "You are correct. And it talks about American exceptionalism, what it means for American excellence. And right now, the less is trying to make us look like the worst country in the entire world when really is the exact opposite of that. And if you're going to recruit young men and women that want to go serve their country and take an oath to potentially die for their country, those are the true patriots. That was me. I don't want to enter an army that's focused more on what your gender is or what your pronouns are. I want to enter an army that was to kick ass and take names. And I think at some point, we're going to see the reversal of this in about eight months, if I'm being honest with you, because we have got to get back to putting what's most important with our military, and that is our work by the capabilities, not changing names and slogans.",
